      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/florence_south_dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Minneapolis and St. Louis Railroad played a pivotal role in the early development of Florence.",
